1
00:00:00,893 --> 00:00:02,103
(Sheldon:)Now, I know he said it's promising

2
00:00:02,495 --> 00:00:04,205
(Sheldon:)and he's going to collaborate on it,

3
00:00:04,397 --> 00:00:08,277
(Sheldon:)but now that you and I are friends
again, I am at your disposal.

4
00:00:08,434 --> 00:00:10,104
And, frankly, lending my name

5
00:00:10,269 --> 00:00:12,909
(Sheldon:)and reputation to it will help,
because a lot of people think

6
00:00:13,072 --> 00:00:15,782
(Sheldon:)that you're a washed-up has-been.

7
00:00:15,941 --> 00:00:17,941
(Sheldon:)Or dead.

8
00:00:19,078 --> 00:00:20,618
(Arthur:)I should be so lucky.

9
00:00:22,548 --> 00:00:23,788
So, what do you say?

10
00:00:24,784 --> 00:00:26,284
(Howard:)You know,
if it's all the same with you,

11
00:00:26,452 --> 00:00:27,952
I think I'll stick with Leonard.

12
00:00:28,721 --> 00:00:32,131
(Sheldon:)It's because I'm annoying, right?
I know it is. Say it.

13
00:00:32,291 --> 00:00:33,631
(Sheldon:)Say it. Say I'm annoying.

14
00:00:33,793 --> 00:00:34,963
(Arthur:)-Good night.
-Say it.

15
00:00:35,127 --> 00:00:39,097
(Sheldon:)Arthur, say it.
Say I'm annoying. Say it. Say it.

16
00:00:39,265 --> 00:00:41,105
(Sheldon:)I'm annoying. Say it.

17
00:00:42,134 --> 00:00:43,544
You're annoying!

18
00:00:46,972 --> 00:00:48,142
Wow, that really hurt.

19
00:00:54,313 --> 00:00:55,983
(Leonard:)If you would have told me
when I was a kid

20
00:00:56,148 --> 00:00:57,888
(Leonard:)that someday
I would be doing science

21
00:00:57,983 --> 00:01:01,023
(Leonard:)next to Professor Proton,
I would not have believed you.

